WEBVTT

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:07.030
Type your bank's name in the Name box

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:14.144
Select Search

00:00:14.144 --> 00:00:23.535
Check the city and state, then select View Details

00:00:23.535 --> 00:00:29.244
Open the Financials tab

00:00:29.244 --> 00:00:35.036
Select Financial Reporting

00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:43.600
Select your bank's name again to open its reports

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.131
Set Report Type to Summary Table

00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:52.587
Select Generate Report

00:00:52.587 --> 00:00:57.408
Open 4. Performance Ratios

00:00:57.408 --> 00:01:03.664
Read the Net Interest Margin row
